cat.c is from suckless's sbase (https://git.suckless.org/sbase/),
ported to uc386 verbatim. The util.h / util.c shim in this directory
is a uc386-specific minimal compatibility layer (not from sbase).
Both are MIT-licensed.

Sbase's full author list lives at https://git.suckless.org/sbase/plain/LICENSE.
The same MIT statement reproduced in addons/gnu/sbase-tee/LICENSE
applies here.
